    <briefdescription>
<para>Our current alias analysis API differentiates heavily between calls and non-calls, and functions called on one usually assert on the other. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class encapsulates the distinction to simplify other code that wants &quot;Memory affecting instructions and related data&quot; to use as a key. For example, this class is used as a densemap key in the use optimizer. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
